WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:52.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:52.800 --> 01:54.640
CAI RONGGEN

3
02:15.600 --> 02:16.440
Hello, everyone.

4
02:16.520 --> 02:20.040
I'm Zheng Yu, from Qing Yi University's College of Life Sciences.

5
02:27.720 --> 02:30.680
As we all know, aluminum adjuvants usually deliver antigens

6
02:30.760 --> 02:33.200
by attaching to the surface of cell membranes.

7
02:33.280 --> 02:34.720
They don't enter the cells themselves,

8
02:35.320 --> 02:38.720
so they can't participate in intracellular antigen processing and presentation.

9
02:38.800 --> 02:40.520
Due to this drawback,

10
02:40.600 --> 02:41.960
in practical applications,

11
02:42.040 --> 02:45.800
using them alone doesn't provide comprehensive protection for the body.

12
02:46.880 --> 02:49.320
Our project proposes modifying traditional aluminum adjuvants

13
02:49.400 --> 02:51.360
by converting them into a particulate form

14
02:51.440 --> 02:54.440
to improve their ability to induce cellular immunity.

15
03:24.240 --> 03:26.080
That concludes our presentation.

16
03:40.440 --> 03:41.680
Ms. Zheng Yu,

17
03:41.760 --> 03:45.240
how safe is this particulate aluminum adjuvant emulsion?

18
03:45.320 --> 03:49.320
Aluminum adjuvants are currently the only adjuvants approved for clinical use.

19
03:49.400 --> 03:51.760
And the raw materials for this emulsion

20
03:52.400 --> 03:54.640
are clinically approved squalene and aluminum adjuvants.

21
03:55.280 --> 03:56.760
It is exceptionally safe.

22
03:56.840 --> 03:59.760
We've also conducted corresponding experiments to verify this.

23
03:59.840 --> 04:00.720
I have a question.

24
04:00.800 --> 04:02.440
Emulsion particles are relatively large.

25
04:02.520 --> 04:05.400
Wouldn't this affect the endocytosis by antigen-presenting cells?

26
04:06.080 --> 04:08.720
By adding the particles to the oil emulsion system

27
04:08.800 --> 04:10.760
and blending them using the method we chose,

28
04:10.840 --> 04:12.640
we produced uniform particle sizes of 500 nm.

29
04:13.440 --> 04:15.480
If we can further optimize preparation conditions,

30
04:15.560 --> 04:18.920
we should be able to produce an even more optimal particle size.

31
04:19.000 --> 04:20.279
Mr. Cai.

32
04:20.360 --> 04:21.600
Do you have any questions?

33
04:43.360 --> 04:46.000
Let's thank this student for an excellent presentation.

34
04:47.800 --> 04:50.120
GUIDANCE AND CONSTRUCTIVE CRITICISM GREATLY APPRECIATED!

35
04:55.560 --> 04:58.840
Next, a team from The Qing Yi University of Engineering.

36
04:58.920 --> 05:00.840
Representing their team is

37
05:00.920 --> 05:04.240
Jiang Yingtian, a biotechnology student from the College of Life Sciences.

38
05:10.320 --> 05:11.760
Hello, respected judges.

39
05:11.840 --> 05:13.560
My name is Jiang Yingtian.

40
05:14.240 --> 05:16.080
I asked some industry veterans

41
05:16.160 --> 05:18.880
who work in this field to help me collect these photos.

42
05:18.960 --> 05:21.000
With these photos as supporting material,

43
05:21.080 --> 05:23.960
I gained a much clearer understanding of my project's research direction.

44
05:33.680 --> 05:36.720
Before this, I thought we wouldn't have any problem winning first prize.

45
05:36.800 --> 05:40.120
But after hearing your presentation, we might win the grand prize.

46
05:40.200 --> 05:44.320
Now, I might really have to rely on you to redeem my reputation.

47
05:44.400 --> 05:46.680
You didn't hear the other presentations.

48
05:51.720 --> 05:53.480
Li Yanan said they were pretty average.

49
05:54.360 --> 05:56.920
There are still plenty of contestants who haven't presented.

50
05:57.800 --> 06:00.120
Besides, every judge has different preferences.

51
06:00.200 --> 06:02.600
I made the images on one of my slides too small.

52
06:03.640 --> 06:05.480
I could barely see them on the stage.

53
06:06.120 --> 06:08.240
And I even stumbled over some of my words.

54
06:10.280 --> 06:11.120
What's wrong with you?

55
06:21.720 --> 06:22.600
Chen Yanzhou.

56
06:23.880 --> 06:25.360
Honestly, I'm someone

57
06:26.320 --> 06:28.800
who's pretty unlucky most of the time.

58
06:31.480 --> 06:33.800
If we end up empty-handed,

59
06:35.000 --> 06:36.120
will you be disappointed?

60
06:38.240 --> 06:40.440
I was wondering where you two had disappeared to.

61
06:44.040 --> 06:44.960
We came out for some air.

62
06:46.120 --> 06:49.720
Did you come to the finals to compete with students from other universities,

63
06:49.800 --> 06:53.080
or are you just here to inspect your teammate's presentation?

64
06:54.400 --> 06:55.240
Here.

65
06:55.320 --> 06:56.720
THE ORDER OF MOUNTAINS TEA CEREMONY

66
06:56.800 --> 06:58.640
Do I get a prize just for making it to the finals?

67
06:58.720 --> 07:00.480
What prize?

68
07:00.560 --> 07:02.200
You put in the wrong address.

69
07:02.280 --> 07:04.560
The stuff you bought online got delivered to my place.

70
07:08.680 --> 07:09.920
-You bought-- -Let's go.

71
07:10.000 --> 07:11.640
Let's get back and watch.

72
07:11.720 --> 07:12.960
What's the rush?

73
07:13.800 --> 07:16.640
I'll head inside first. The final results will be out in three days.

74
07:16.720 --> 07:19.040
Don't overthink things these next few days.

75
07:19.920 --> 07:23.640
-Let's go. -Goodness. What's going on now?

76
07:31.640 --> 07:33.480
We have conducted long-term safety monitoring.

77
07:33.560 --> 07:34.600
All right, all right.

78
07:34.680 --> 07:36.720
So the main focus is on public education,

79
07:36.800 --> 07:40.680
making a higher level of social awareness absolutely crucial.

80
07:40.760 --> 07:43.080
Under our professor's guidance, we're all thinking about

81
07:43.160 --> 07:46.640
what kind of academic contribution is best to use as our research direction?

82
07:46.720 --> 07:49.880
You should be more careful when buying things next time.

83
07:49.960 --> 07:53.920
It's all because I helped you snag that limited-edition fishing rod last time.

84
07:54.000 --> 07:56.000
Otherwise, I wouldn't have used your address.

85
07:56.080 --> 07:57.200
Why are you blaming me?

86
07:59.920 --> 08:01.400
Good thing I did use the wrong address.

87
08:02.240 --> 08:03.080
What?

88
08:04.280 --> 08:05.200
Nothing.

89
08:07.160 --> 08:09.960
I even went out of my way to put it in a bag for you that said "tea."

90
08:10.040 --> 08:11.640
Give it back to me then.

91
08:16.720 --> 08:19.680
My wife saw this and got the wrong idea, do you know that?

92
08:21.680 --> 08:23.840
Why did you buy women's perfume?

93
08:26.040 --> 08:29.280
I bought it to study the ingredients.

94
08:31.960 --> 08:33.919
Aren't you studying thale cress?

95
08:34.600 --> 08:36.200
When did you change research topics?

96
08:36.280 --> 08:37.440
Why do you care so much?

97
08:38.840 --> 08:39.720
Good.

98
08:46.400 --> 08:49.040
THANK YOU

99
08:52.480 --> 08:53.680
What's that?

100
08:56.640 --> 08:57.560
Mind your own business.

101
08:57.640 --> 08:58.520
All right then.

102
09:02.720 --> 09:06.320
EVALUATION SHEET EXCELLENCE CUP

103
09:10.320 --> 09:12.440
Mr. Sun, Mr. Cai, we're heading off now.

104
09:12.520 --> 09:14.120
-All right. -Take care.

105
09:16.680 --> 09:17.520
Speaking of which,

106
09:17.600 --> 09:20.440
the contestant who impressed me most was No. 6.

107
09:20.520 --> 09:22.360
The girl from Qing Yi University, right?

108
09:22.440 --> 09:24.360
Commercial aluminum adjuvants. It was good.

109
09:24.440 --> 09:26.120
You wouldn't know she was just a junior.

110
09:27.240 --> 09:28.080
Everyone thinks so?

111
09:28.160 --> 09:31.360
In that case, the grand prize is pretty much decided, isn't it?

112
09:32.800 --> 09:33.720
-Mr. Cai. -Yes?

113
09:33.800 --> 09:36.360
You're the key person here. What do you think?

114
09:36.440 --> 09:41.080
Knowing Ms. Ye, if she were here, she'd definitely pick No. 6, right?

115
09:42.320 --> 09:43.160
And Mr. Cai…

116
09:43.240 --> 09:44.560
Birds of a feather flock together.

117
09:44.640 --> 09:47.000
I'm guessing you'd bet on No. 6 too, right?

118
09:50.320 --> 09:52.440
No. 6 was certainly impressive.

119
09:52.520 --> 09:54.360
But…

120
09:54.440 --> 09:57.120
I believe No. 7 might be more interesting.

121
09:59.680 --> 10:02.240
I also believe No. 7 was pretty good.

122
10:02.320 --> 10:04.680
As for No. 6, she was solid in content,

123
10:05.600 --> 10:08.680
but her delivery was a little…

124
10:09.800 --> 10:10.800
rigid.

125
10:12.080 --> 10:12.960
How about this?

126
10:13.040 --> 10:15.920
Let's get a copy of the competition footage and send it to Ms. Ye.

127
10:16.000 --> 10:18.720
We won't waste too much of her time.

128
10:18.800 --> 10:20.760
We'll just copy the clips of No. 6 and No. 7

129
10:20.840 --> 10:22.120
and let her judge them.

130
10:22.200 --> 10:23.960
How about we make a bet?

131
10:24.040 --> 10:25.120
Sounds good to me.

132
10:27.720 --> 10:29.080
Anyway…

133
10:29.160 --> 10:32.240
We still have something to attend to, so we'll get going.

134
10:32.320 --> 10:33.920
All right, take care.

135
10:37.360 --> 10:38.920
-Mr. Cai. -Yes?

136
10:39.000 --> 10:42.520
I have a bottle of fine wine I've been saving at the Jinkairui Hotel.

137
10:42.600 --> 10:45.160
I know you appreciate good wine, so I'd love for you to try it.

138
10:45.800 --> 10:49.000
I also have some business matters I'd like to discuss with you.

139
10:51.520 --> 10:53.760
Let's skip the drinks if we're talking business.

140
10:53.840 --> 10:55.760
Drinking too much can cause problems.

141
10:56.600 --> 10:57.760
We're all on the same side.

142
10:57.840 --> 10:59.400
If we drink behind closed doors,

143
10:59.480 --> 11:02.680
no one outside will hear about it, even if anything goes wrong.

144
11:05.440 --> 11:08.000
Look, I really have plans tonight.

145
11:08.640 --> 11:10.760
And for business matters,

146
11:10.840 --> 11:12.680
Ms. Ye Sheng has the final say.

147
11:13.440 --> 11:15.520
As you've seen, I don't have much say in this.

148
11:16.680 --> 11:18.320
In that case, regarding the wine…

149
11:18.400 --> 11:20.360
-Let's save it for next time. -Sure.

150
11:21.480 --> 11:22.720
I'll get going.

151
11:23.440 --> 11:25.720
Mr. Wu, Mr. Sun. I'll leave first.

152
11:25.800 --> 11:28.520
-All right. Take care, Mr. Cai. -See you around!

153
11:41.280 --> 11:43.600
YE SHENG, CHAIRMAN AND CEO OF NINGSHENG BIOTECH

154
12:00.200 --> 12:02.680
ABOUT NINGSHENG

155
12:02.760 --> 12:03.960
PRODUCTS AND SERVICES

156
12:14.680 --> 12:17.080
This university town is really full of hidden talent.

157
12:18.800 --> 12:20.000
Who would've thought

158
12:20.080 --> 12:22.360
that a girl working part-time at a convenience store

159
12:22.440 --> 12:24.040
was actually a top student?

160
12:26.720 --> 12:28.040
The final results aren't out yet.

161
12:28.640 --> 12:30.560
As a sponsor's representative,

162
12:30.640 --> 12:33.440
isn't it inappropriate for you to meet a contestant in private?

163
12:36.880 --> 12:40.680
This isn't the first time we've met in private, is it?

164
12:43.120 --> 12:44.560
Let me put it this way.

165
12:44.640 --> 12:45.720
I came to see you

166
12:45.800 --> 12:48.200
because I want to make another deal with you.

167
12:50.320 --> 12:51.240
Another deal?

168
12:51.840 --> 12:53.160
Compensation is compensation.

169
12:53.920 --> 12:55.520
It has nothing to do with a deal.

170
13:01.280 --> 13:02.120
Fine.

171
13:02.680 --> 13:05.240
Let's go somewhere else to talk when you get off work.

172
13:06.040 --> 13:07.800
We'll talk about your competition project.

173
13:14.080 --> 13:16.280
-Boss, can I have some of this? -What do you think?

174
13:17.160 --> 13:18.240
This is delicious.

175
13:18.320 --> 13:20.080
DRY MALATANG

176
13:21.920 --> 13:24.040
Have some more.

177
13:33.360 --> 13:34.200
Sit.

178
13:37.200 --> 13:38.720
You get off work this late?

179
13:38.800 --> 13:40.200
How much do you make a day?

180
13:41.920 --> 13:42.960
What exactly do you want?

181
13:49.080 --> 13:50.160
Take out your phone.

182
13:54.720 --> 13:56.080
I'm not like you.

183
13:56.160 --> 13:57.480
I won't record this secretly.

184
13:58.600 --> 13:59.720
Turn it off.

185
14:15.040 --> 14:16.320
Withdraw from the competition.

186
14:22.440 --> 14:25.560
As for your reason for withdrawing, just state that

187
14:26.240 --> 14:27.440
your project was ghostwritten.

188
14:29.960 --> 14:31.560
Do you think I'd ruin my own future?

189
14:33.080 --> 14:35.080
It's not as serious as you think.

190
14:35.160 --> 14:37.120
As long as you agree, I'll give you some compensation.

191
14:38.960 --> 14:40.600
Why don't you think it over?

192
14:47.960 --> 14:50.600
You don't really think you'll win that prize money, do you?

193
14:50.680 --> 14:55.040
I can tell you with absolute certainty that your project won't win a prize.

194
14:55.800 --> 14:58.240
If you really have the power to keep me from winning,

195
14:58.320 --> 15:00.800
then why are you asking me to withdraw?

196
15:03.400 --> 15:05.040
You're missing the point.

197
15:11.240 --> 15:12.720
My goal

198
15:12.800 --> 15:13.920
isn't to make you withdraw.

199
15:14.560 --> 15:16.240
It's to make you admit your project is fake.

200
15:17.280 --> 15:20.000
The moment you do that, I'll transfer 50,000 to you right away.

201
15:22.880 --> 15:24.080
Fifty thousand.

202
15:30.360 --> 15:31.360
Is my reputation

203
15:31.880 --> 15:33.120
that valuable?

204
15:47.800 --> 15:48.960
Hello.

205
15:49.040 --> 15:50.040
Mr. Cao.

206
15:51.520 --> 15:53.200
About that bottle of wine you mentioned.

207
15:53.280 --> 15:54.920
I think tonight's the night to open it.

208
15:55.840 --> 15:58.840
Mr. Cai, are you done with your plans?

209
15:59.720 --> 16:01.280
I just finished up.

210
16:02.200 --> 16:04.440
I'm bringing an extra person tonight. You don't mind, do you?

211
16:04.520 --> 16:06.280
We can use this chance to discuss business.

212
16:06.360 --> 16:08.320
May I ask which executive?

213
16:10.040 --> 16:11.120
Boss Jiang.

214
16:12.600 --> 16:13.440
Jiang?

215
16:13.520 --> 16:16.520
I heard his son is also competing in the Excellence Cup.

216
16:20.680 --> 16:22.440
There's no rush. Let's talk when we meet.

217
16:41.120 --> 16:46.160
CHEN YANZHOU

218
16:56.600 --> 16:57.840
HELLO, PATIENT JIANG HAIZHEN.

219
16:57.920 --> 17:01.120
YOU HAVE OUTSTANDING MEDICAL BILLS TOTALING 1202.01 YUAN.

220
17:17.640 --> 17:20.200
Zheng Yu. You're back.

221
17:23.640 --> 17:26.800
Those two went on a trip. They left as soon as the competition ended.

222
17:27.440 --> 17:30.600
They said there was still time, and they didn't want to waste the break.

223
17:43.840 --> 17:44.880
Zheng Yu.

224
17:47.040 --> 17:49.840
You were amazing on stage today.

225
17:49.920 --> 17:53.040
I've never seen you compete in anything like this before.

226
17:53.120 --> 17:55.360
I watched all the other teams that presented after you.

227
17:55.440 --> 17:57.000
Your team is definitely winning a prize.

228
17:58.400 --> 17:59.280
Do you think so?

229
18:22.080 --> 18:25.240
INTEGRATION OF UPSTREAM SIGNALING PATHWAYS WITH AUTOPHAGY-RELATED PROTEINS

230
18:33.200 --> 18:35.560
THE ORDER OF MOUNTAINS TEA CEREMONY

231
18:45.680 --> 18:47.520
This perfume smells really good.

232
18:47.600 --> 18:49.320
When you first spray it,

233
18:49.400 --> 18:50.840
it smells like the rain.

234
18:51.600 --> 18:53.200
After ten minutes,

235
18:53.280 --> 18:55.280
it transforms into the warmth of sunshine.

236
19:13.840 --> 19:17.120
Which irresponsible person wrote such nonsense perfume reviews online?

237
20:13.480 --> 20:14.320
Not a chance.

238
20:30.120 --> 20:31.800
THANK YOU

239
20:44.000 --> 20:45.640
"NingSheng BioTech."

240
20:46.240 --> 20:47.080
Sounds very familiar.

241
20:48.400 --> 20:50.280
YE SHENG, CHAIRMAN AND CEO OF NINGSHENG BIOTECH

242
21:03.440 --> 21:04.920
EXCELLENCE CUP COMPETITION OVERVIEW

243
21:05.000 --> 21:06.840
MULTIPLE RESEARCH DIRECTIONS SHOWCASED

244
21:09.120 --> 21:12.320
The publicity team even took a solo photo of Zheng Yu.

245
21:23.800 --> 21:25.280
Chen Yanzhou.

246
21:25.360 --> 21:27.440
Honestly, I'm someone

247
21:27.520 --> 21:29.960
who's pretty unlucky most of the time.

248
21:30.800 --> 21:33.160
If we end up empty-handed,

249
21:33.240 --> 21:34.760
will you be disappointed?

250
21:55.080 --> 21:56.840
Class is over, and you're still grading?

251
21:56.920 --> 21:59.560
Why? Did you come in last in the competition?

252
21:59.640 --> 22:00.680
The results aren't out yet.

253
22:08.280 --> 22:09.280
Chen Huimei once said

254
22:09.360 --> 22:11.920
that every competition is a battle of mindset.

255
22:12.000 --> 22:14.680
If your mindset is weak, your opponents will seize the opportunity.

256
22:14.760 --> 22:17.800
If your mindset is strong, your opponents will start to panic.

257
22:17.880 --> 22:19.640
The results aren't even out yet.

258
22:19.720 --> 22:21.240
Why do you look like you've already lost?

259
22:23.280 --> 22:24.640
What competitions have you entered?

260
22:25.520 --> 22:27.480
There are way too many.

261
22:27.560 --> 22:30.240
Rubber-band jumping, shuttlecock-kicking,

262
22:30.320 --> 22:33.240
competitive eating, skipping…

263
22:33.320 --> 22:34.560
That's all for today's session.

264
22:42.160 --> 22:44.280
About the Lantern Festival,

265
22:44.360 --> 22:45.840
will you reconsider?

266
22:45.920 --> 22:47.120
No.

267
23:03.320 --> 23:04.680
PLAN WISELY, SUCCEED SMOOTHLY

268
23:12.160 --> 23:16.320
We have too many Lunar New Year supplies. My parents said to bring Gao Xing some.

269
23:18.360 --> 23:20.280
The tutoring session is over. You can go in.

270
23:29.680 --> 23:31.360
What? You've changed your mind?

271
23:33.480 --> 23:34.680
Ms. Zheng.

272
23:35.320 --> 23:36.960
Ms. Zheng Yu.

273
23:38.000 --> 23:38.840
Zheng Yu.

274
23:39.960 --> 23:41.040
Ms. Zheng!

275
23:48.160 --> 23:50.960
THREE MEALS, FOUR SEASONS WARM AND JOYFUL

276
24:01.160 --> 24:02.280
Sir!

277
24:13.600 --> 24:14.800
Excuse me.

278
24:22.520 --> 24:23.680
What's up?

279
24:31.240 --> 24:32.400
On the day of the presentation,

280
24:32.480 --> 24:35.280
you asked if I'd be disappointed if we didn't win anything.

281
24:35.920 --> 24:37.400
I haven't answered you yet.

282
24:44.040 --> 24:45.120
If we don't win,

283
24:45.720 --> 24:46.920
I won't be disappointed.

284
24:47.480 --> 24:48.960
I'll just think the judges have no taste.

285
24:50.280 --> 24:53.560
If we disagree with the results, we can appeal to the organizing committee.

286
24:54.160 --> 24:55.920
If our appeal is rejected,

287
24:56.000 --> 24:59.080
we will revise our paper and submit it for publication again.

288
25:00.000 --> 25:03.160
Either way, the work we've done and the effort we've put in

289
25:03.240 --> 25:04.600
won't go to waste just like that.

290
25:09.160 --> 25:11.200
If we don't win any prizes,

291
25:12.240 --> 25:14.480
the Campus Forum will probably be flooded with posts again.

292
25:17.240 --> 25:19.240
Are you worried about me?

293
25:30.040 --> 25:31.960
It's not like this is the only project I'm doing.

294
25:32.600 --> 25:34.920
I'll have plenty of chances to shut them up.

295
25:38.280 --> 25:39.720
Actually…

296
26:22.200 --> 26:24.800
Did you get on the wrong bus? This one doesn't go to the campus.

297
26:26.720 --> 26:28.040
Are you going to the university?

298
26:29.360 --> 26:30.240
I'm going to the lab.

299
26:31.000 --> 26:32.200
I'm not going that way.

300
26:32.880 --> 26:34.160
I'm going to the hospital.

301
26:57.200 --> 26:58.200
Just hold it right here.

302
27:04.120 --> 27:05.360
Keep your receipt.

303
27:07.800 --> 27:08.800
Next.

304
27:13.240 --> 27:16.080
INCOMING CALL

305
27:23.120 --> 27:25.040
Well? Have you thought it through?

306
27:26.960 --> 27:28.760
If you're worried I'll go back on my word,

307
27:28.840 --> 27:31.600
I can transfer a 25,000 deposit to you right now.

308
27:33.720 --> 27:35.040
Chen Huimei once said

309
27:35.120 --> 27:37.520
that every competition is a battle of mindset.

310
27:37.600 --> 27:40.480
If your mindset is weak, your opponents will seize the opportunity.

311
27:40.560 --> 27:43.320
If your mindset is strong, your opponents will start to panic.

312
27:57.680 --> 27:59.640
RECENT CALLS, ZHENG YU

313
28:07.520 --> 28:09.920
I wasn't looking at my phone earlier. What happened?

314
28:10.000 --> 28:11.400
I'm almost at the lab building.

315
28:11.480 --> 28:12.600
Let's meet at the usual spot.

316
28:12.680 --> 28:13.640
Sure.

317
28:24.640 --> 28:27.240
Three, two, one.

318
28:57.280 --> 28:59.520
The motion sensor light here is unreliable.

319
28:59.600 --> 29:01.080
Knocking on the railing works better.

320
29:15.520 --> 29:17.920
So much has happened in just two days.

321
29:20.880 --> 29:22.600
What did you tell him in the end?

322
29:23.600 --> 29:24.560
I said

323
29:24.640 --> 29:26.080
I'd think it over

324
29:26.160 --> 29:28.920
and give him an answer by noon tomorrow.

325
29:30.520 --> 29:33.440
He was literally crying poor to you at the coffee shop last time.

326
29:34.120 --> 29:35.440
How did he suddenly get so generous,

327
29:35.520 --> 29:38.200
trying to throw money around to humiliate people now?

328
29:39.680 --> 29:40.680
Unless…

329
29:40.760 --> 29:43.960
Unless, after making this one generous offer,

330
29:44.040 --> 29:45.360
he stands to make even more money.

331
29:46.560 --> 29:48.320
You think he took money from other contestants?

332
29:49.600 --> 29:51.480
If it weren't for that phone call today,

333
29:51.560 --> 29:53.200
I wouldn't have known how desperate he was.

334
29:55.160 --> 29:57.040
We should report to the university.

335
29:58.400 --> 30:00.920
Without evidence, they might not get involved.

336
30:01.000 --> 30:04.040
We could've made a case out of Cai Ronggen hitting someone,

337
30:04.120 --> 30:05.560
but I signed the settlement agreement.

338
30:05.640 --> 30:07.480
Bringing it up now won't do much good.

339
30:11.440 --> 30:14.600
-Do you know Ye Sheng? -The boss of NingSheng BioTech?

340
30:16.120 --> 30:18.960
If I knew her, I wouldn't be in this predicament.

341
30:21.120 --> 30:24.920
I saw a photo of you and her in the counselor's office.

342
30:28.280 --> 30:29.320
How is that possible?

343
30:30.800 --> 30:34.280
WELFARE PROJECT: HELPING UNDERPRIVILEGED STUDENTS REALIZE THEIR DREAMS

344
30:49.680 --> 30:50.600
Hello?

345
30:52.520 --> 30:54.200
I've been thinking these past few days.

346
30:55.040 --> 30:56.880
If you'd been the one on stage,

347
30:57.840 --> 31:00.600
would Cai Ronggen have left us alone?

348
31:01.680 --> 31:03.120
Because you just don't look like

349
31:03.760 --> 31:05.840
the kind of person who'd be swayed by money.

350
31:10.880 --> 31:12.240
I know what I need to do now.

351
31:39.920 --> 31:41.480
Hello, how can I help you?

352
31:43.680 --> 31:46.680
-Hello. I'd like to see Ms. Ye Sheng. -Do you have an appointment?

353
31:49.080 --> 31:50.480
Then I'm afraid I can't assist you.

354
31:50.560 --> 31:52.240
Please schedule an appointment first.

355
31:52.320 --> 31:55.160
Could you call Ms. Ye for me? I'd like to speak with her directly.

356
31:55.240 --> 31:58.080
It's currently lunch break, so we can't disturb her right now.

357
32:03.280 --> 32:05.160
I'm a student at Qing Yi University.

358
32:05.800 --> 32:07.800
Two years ago, I received financial support from her.

359
32:07.880 --> 32:11.000
She told me if I ever ran into trouble, I could come here to see her.

360
32:12.960 --> 32:14.760
Please wait a moment. I'll call and check.

361
32:25.200 --> 32:27.520
Is Mr. Cai Ronggen not in today?

362
32:27.600 --> 32:30.520
He is. But he's probably having lunch in the canteen at this hour.

363
32:30.600 --> 32:32.240
You have a canteen here?

364
32:32.320 --> 32:33.600
We do. It's on the first floor.

365
32:33.680 --> 32:36.560
Our company canteen is famous around here.

366
32:36.640 --> 32:37.520
This way, please.

367
32:44.480 --> 32:45.600
Please come in.

368
32:46.480 --> 32:47.520
All right.

369
32:48.240 --> 32:49.520
I'm listening.

370
32:53.680 --> 32:56.640
We still need to discuss some of the details.

371
32:59.920 --> 33:01.560
You name the time.

372
33:01.640 --> 33:02.800
Great.

373
33:03.760 --> 33:04.680
It's a deal then.

374
33:04.760 --> 33:05.960
Goodbye.

375
33:06.880 --> 33:07.800
Hello, Ms. Ye.

376
33:07.880 --> 33:10.040
I'm Zheng Yu, a student in the College of Life Sciences.

377
33:11.240 --> 33:12.360
I remember you.

378
33:12.440 --> 33:13.680
Have a seat.

379
33:15.360 --> 33:17.280
I visited your campus two years ago

380
33:17.360 --> 33:20.400
for the Corporate Scholarship Award Ceremony.

381
33:20.480 --> 33:22.760
The outstanding student representatives there

382
33:22.840 --> 33:24.400
weren't very keen to take photos with me.

383
33:25.000 --> 33:27.200
You were the first person to come up and take a photo with me.

384
33:27.840 --> 33:30.480
You brought your own photography crew along back then.

385
33:30.560 --> 33:33.280
The whole spectacle scared all the students off.

386
33:33.360 --> 33:35.440
They were afraid of ending up on the front page.

387
33:35.520 --> 33:38.600
They weren't photographers. They were my PR team.

388
33:39.160 --> 33:40.440
When I sponsor students' tuition,

389
33:40.520 --> 33:43.600
I genuinely hope to help those who aren't as fortunate.

390
33:43.680 --> 33:45.000
I mean that sincerely.

391
33:47.200 --> 33:51.920
I also hope my company can build a good public image.

392
33:52.000 --> 33:53.480
I mean that sincerely too.

393
33:53.560 --> 33:56.240
Those two goals don't have to conflict.

394
33:58.160 --> 34:01.880
But I never said you could come look for me here whenever you had trouble.

395
34:03.760 --> 34:04.760
Recently,

396
34:04.840 --> 34:07.360
I participated in the Excellence Cup sponsored by your company.

397
34:07.960 --> 34:10.040
-I made it to the finals. -Is that so?

398
34:10.719 --> 34:11.840
Congratulations.

399
34:14.679 --> 34:17.440
Unfortunately, I had something come up that day, so I couldn't attend.

400
34:21.840 --> 34:22.880
Very unfortunate.

401
34:25.840 --> 34:26.840
What do you mean?

402
34:31.639 --> 34:33.400
Since you value your company's image so much,

403
34:33.480 --> 34:36.239
you definitely wouldn't allow this to happen.

404
34:36.320 --> 34:37.400
So

405
34:38.080 --> 34:40.000
you're not just helping me.

406
34:40.080 --> 34:41.960
Didn't you say

407
34:42.040 --> 34:45.639
you sincerely hoped to help those who weren't as fortunate

408
34:46.239 --> 34:47.280
two years ago?

409
34:48.400 --> 34:50.600
And now, as someone who received your help,

410
34:50.679 --> 34:51.800
I'm sitting here

411
34:52.400 --> 34:53.840
with the same sincerity.

412
35:04.320 --> 35:06.600
CAI RONGGEN

413
35:07.560 --> 35:09.520
Have you made up your mind?

414
35:12.120 --> 35:14.120
CAI RONGGEN

415
35:25.080 --> 35:26.840
Something came up. We'll talk later.

416
35:33.280 --> 35:34.240
Mr. Zhang.

417
35:34.920 --> 35:36.400
Mr. Cai, what bad timing.

418
35:36.480 --> 35:38.120
I just made plans with Xiaowang.

419
35:38.200 --> 35:40.960
We need to quickly go over this afternoon's data report.

420
35:41.520 --> 35:42.800
Always so busy!

421
35:42.880 --> 35:44.320
Not at all.

422
35:44.400 --> 35:46.120
It's all thanks to Ms. Ye's leadership.

423
35:46.200 --> 35:48.840
She has high standards, so we can't afford to slack off.

424
35:49.440 --> 35:50.560
That's true.

425
35:50.640 --> 35:53.600
Ms. Ye's drive for perfection is truly rare.

426
35:53.680 --> 35:54.560
That's for sure.

427
35:55.520 --> 35:57.280
That's what you get with a female boss.

428
35:57.960 --> 35:59.520
Women nowadays are different.

429
35:59.600 --> 36:00.840
They're impressive.

430
36:01.760 --> 36:03.000
I'll let you get back to work.

431
36:03.080 --> 36:04.680
All right, take care.

432
36:32.000 --> 36:33.280
You shouldn't be here.

433
36:34.720 --> 36:36.720
When you proposed that deal,

434
36:36.800 --> 36:38.240
did you never expect me to come here?

435
36:39.640 --> 36:41.840
It seems you no longer want the money.

436
36:43.480 --> 36:45.000
I'd rather win the prize money.

437
36:46.680 --> 36:48.760
You really think you can win the prize?

438
36:51.280 --> 36:52.480
Fine.

439
36:52.560 --> 36:54.000
Let's wait for the results then.

440
36:55.840 --> 36:56.960
Wait for what results?

441
36:57.720 --> 36:59.760
Wait for you to return the bribe money you took

442
37:01.360 --> 37:03.320
and act like nothing ever happened?

443
37:10.360 --> 37:11.840
I have no idea what you're talking about.

444
37:13.120 --> 37:15.800
How much did you sell the grand prize for?

445
37:29.440 --> 37:31.000
RECENT CALLS, ZHENG YU

446
37:35.760 --> 37:38.360
The number you have dialed is currently busy.

447
37:41.280 --> 37:43.040
So you're saying

448
37:43.120 --> 37:45.960
I want to trick you into withdrawing for free,

449
37:46.040 --> 37:47.880
and then make a huge profit off someone else?

450
37:47.960 --> 37:49.080
Don't you?

451
37:49.640 --> 37:50.880
You're just gambling

452
37:51.720 --> 37:54.200
on how far someone like me, who could be bought,

453
37:54.280 --> 37:56.320
would go for money.

454
38:00.240 --> 38:01.920
Which student paid you off?

455
38:02.760 --> 38:04.480
If our team withdraws,

456
38:04.560 --> 38:06.520
that person gets the grand prize.

457
38:08.440 --> 38:09.480
No. 16?

458
38:10.640 --> 38:12.000
No. 21?

459
38:12.080 --> 38:14.040
Or…

460
38:15.360 --> 38:16.600
No. 7?

461
38:21.880 --> 38:22.960
Say whatever you want.

462
38:23.040 --> 38:24.480
No one's going to believe you anyway.

463
38:25.080 --> 38:26.120
Leave now.

464
38:26.200 --> 38:27.760
If you don't leave, I'm calling security.

465
38:35.400 --> 38:36.560
Wait!

466
38:38.960 --> 38:39.800
Take out your phone.

467
38:44.080 --> 38:44.920
YE SHENG

468
38:45.000 --> 38:46.120
Cai Ronggen.

469
38:50.000 --> 38:50.840
Ms. Ye.

470
38:50.920 --> 38:53.880
You've heard everything you need to hear. I'll hang up now.

471
38:59.480 --> 39:00.320
Mr. Cai.

472
39:01.520 --> 39:03.440
I'm afraid you won't be presenting our prizes.

473
39:05.720 --> 39:06.600
What a pity.

474
39:39.120 --> 39:42.760
Hello, have you seen a girl carrying a crossbody bag

475
39:42.840 --> 39:44.720
and wearing a green coat come upstairs?

476
39:44.800 --> 39:45.680
I did.

477
39:45.760 --> 39:47.640
My colleague was the one who helped her.

478
39:47.720 --> 39:49.720
She's probably eating in the canteen right now.

479
39:50.600 --> 39:51.720
Then could you…

480
39:51.800 --> 39:53.080
Something happened over there!

481
39:53.160 --> 39:54.800
Mr. Cai got into a fight with a girl.

482
39:55.440 --> 39:56.680
-Is it true? -Yes.

483
39:56.760 --> 39:57.720
Seriously?

484
39:57.800 --> 39:58.800
Everyone.

485
39:59.360 --> 40:00.920
Please stay calm.

486
40:01.000 --> 40:03.200
Today, I'm going to show you all

487
40:03.280 --> 40:06.080
a perfect example of shameless, despicable behavior.

488
40:06.160 --> 40:09.720
This woman is a student from Qing Yi University.

489
40:09.800 --> 40:13.880
She entered the Excellence Cup sponsored by our company.

490
40:13.960 --> 40:17.320
To win the prize, she tried bribing me with money and gifts.

491
40:17.400 --> 40:19.360
Today, she showed up in person.

492
40:19.440 --> 40:22.200
I think you can all guess what she wanted.

493
40:22.280 --> 40:23.960
I don't need to spell it out, do I?

494
40:24.040 --> 40:26.120
When she failed to seduce me,

495
40:26.200 --> 40:27.600
she threatened me.

496
40:27.680 --> 40:29.800
She said that unless I gave the prize to her team,

497
40:29.880 --> 40:31.440
she'd report me for taking bribes!

498
40:31.520 --> 40:35.840
So I'd like to ask all of you to serve as witnesses

499
40:35.920 --> 40:37.080
and testify that I'm innocent!

500
40:37.160 --> 40:38.200
Thank you, everyone!

501
40:39.920 --> 40:41.800
My goodness!

502
40:51.320 --> 40:52.840
Water!

503
40:52.920 --> 40:54.240
Get me some water!

504
40:54.320 --> 40:56.080
Water! Hurry, get me water!

505
40:57.560 --> 40:58.560
What's that smell?

506
41:02.840 --> 41:03.680
Water…

507
41:03.760 --> 41:05.240
Get me some water!

508
41:05.320 --> 41:06.720
Water! Hurry, get me water!

509
41:09.040 --> 41:10.840
Water! Hurry up!

510
41:10.920 --> 41:12.400
This… Okay, thank you.

511
41:18.400 --> 41:22.160
Even though the liquor isn't that strong, it can at least disinfect a little.

512
42:06.560 --> 42:09.240
Do you think Ye Sheng will take care of this?

513
42:10.320 --> 42:11.160
She will.

514
42:12.200 --> 42:13.160
How are you so sure?

515
42:14.120 --> 42:14.960
Intuition.

516
42:20.600 --> 42:21.600
Did you ever hesitate?

517
42:26.000 --> 42:28.920
If I'd entered the competition alone,

518
42:29.000 --> 42:30.720
I would've demanded even more money.

519
42:37.640 --> 42:38.560
Then

520
42:39.240 --> 42:40.840
it's a good thing you're not alone.

521
42:58.560 --> 43:01.280
I still have work to do. Clean up when you're done eating.

522
43:01.360 --> 43:02.200
Okay.

523
43:06.640 --> 43:07.960
Let me do it.

524
43:08.800 --> 43:11.080
You were so quiet at dinner, but now you're all eager to help.

525
43:12.240 --> 43:15.120
You seem to be in a good mood. Could you do me a small favor?

526
43:16.560 --> 43:17.400
You guessed wrong.

527
43:17.480 --> 43:21.440
Help me convince Ms. Zheng to take me out for the Lantern Festival.

528
43:22.520 --> 43:23.360
Where do you want to go?

529
43:23.440 --> 43:24.800
Anywhere is fine.

530
43:24.880 --> 43:27.760
School starts soon. It'll be too late if I don't go now.

531
43:32.480 --> 43:34.680
I have a way to get her to agree.

532
43:34.760 --> 43:37.400
But you have to agree to one condition.

533
43:39.960 --> 43:42.640
These are the spots where you repeatedly get the answers wrong.

534
43:42.720 --> 43:44.040
You need to review them thoroughly.

535
43:55.920 --> 43:57.440
Life…

536
44:00.440 --> 44:04.400
The field practice we postponed last summer due to base maintenance

537
44:04.480 --> 44:07.360
will take place one week before the start of this semester.

538
44:14.960 --> 44:16.040
Lesson's over.

539
44:38.320 --> 44:39.800
Bringing Lunar New Year supplies again?

540
44:42.160 --> 44:43.320
I need to talk to you.

541
44:45.440 --> 44:46.800
I knew it.

542
44:46.880 --> 44:49.800
The Lantern Festival is coming up, and she's been unusually quiet.

543
44:49.880 --> 44:51.560
Turns out she got you to lobby me.

544
44:53.480 --> 44:55.440
I've thought of plenty of reasons to convince you.

545
44:56.640 --> 44:57.840
For example?

546
44:58.640 --> 45:00.240
For example…

547
45:00.320 --> 45:02.760
Gao Xing has been studying for so long. She needs a break.

548
45:03.360 --> 45:06.080
Her mom couldn't even come home for the holidays,

549
45:06.160 --> 45:07.960
and her dad has started a new life.

550
45:08.040 --> 45:10.440
As her tutor, you should look out for her.

551
45:11.040 --> 45:14.640
If you're worried her mom might object, I can handle that.

552
45:17.000 --> 45:19.520
So which reason are you going with?

553
45:23.440 --> 45:24.880
The break is almost over.

554
45:26.080 --> 45:27.680
Do you want to go out and have fun?

555
45:31.720 --> 45:32.760
Where to?

556
45:33.840 --> 45:34.880
Where do you want to go?

557
45:36.560 --> 45:37.760
I don't know.

558
45:39.200 --> 45:40.040
Think about it.

559
45:42.520 --> 45:43.520
The rollerblading rink.

560
45:45.440 --> 45:47.920
Why the rollerblading rink?

561
45:50.200 --> 45:52.320
I don't know what fun places there are in Qingyi.

562
45:53.080 --> 45:56.920
Now the PE class is over, I haven't had time to do any rollerblading.

563
46:00.160 --> 46:02.320
RECALL MESSAGE

564
46:04.840 --> 46:05.800
Wait.

565
46:05.880 --> 46:07.480
Did you see that message I sent?

566
46:08.560 --> 46:10.240
Why didn't you reply?

567
46:10.320 --> 46:11.480
You withdrew the message.

568
46:11.560 --> 46:12.880
What was there to reply to?

569
46:14.640 --> 46:16.800
Then let's go to the rollerblading rink.

570
46:16.880 --> 46:18.040
I'm not going there.

571
46:19.160 --> 46:21.680
Then where do you want to go? We'll go wherever you want.

572
46:23.240 --> 46:24.440
Anywhere but there.

573
46:25.320 --> 46:26.640
Why are you walking so fast?

574
46:27.800 --> 46:30.800
By the way, I'm planning to submit my paper.

575
46:30.880 --> 46:32.120
You're finally submitting it?

576
46:33.080 --> 46:34.160
Going out and having fun?

577
46:34.240 --> 46:36.160
Sounds like you're the one who wants a break.

578
46:53.360 --> 46:55.400
FORTUNE

579
46:59.960 --> 47:01.520
Ms. Zheng, give me a smile.

580
47:02.600 --> 47:03.840
Come on, just smile.

581
47:03.920 --> 47:04.840
Please?

582
47:15.200 --> 47:16.280
I'll go get my bag.

583
47:16.800 --> 47:19.760
We're going out, yeah!

584
47:24.200 --> 47:27.160
You didn't tell her that her mom knew we were going out?

585
47:28.560 --> 47:30.640
Okay, let's go, let's go!

586
47:32.880 --> 47:33.720
Let's go!

587
47:34.680 --> 47:35.840
Let's go.

588
47:58.280 --> 47:59.440
Have you ever been to the beach?

589
48:02.240 --> 48:03.640
I went when I was little.

590
48:04.760 --> 48:06.000
Qingyi is a coastal city.

591
48:06.080 --> 48:09.040
It's only a 50 or 60-minute drive from the campus to the beach.

592
48:09.800 --> 48:12.160
You've been here so long, and you've never gone?

593
48:15.360 --> 48:16.640
Then make the most of it today.

594
48:31.760 --> 48:34.240
I can't hear a thing. Keep talking.

595
49:17.240 --> 49:18.640
What's in your bag?

596
49:18.720 --> 49:19.640
It's so heavy.

597
49:24.640 --> 49:26.280
This is a mirrorless camera.

598
49:26.360 --> 49:27.920
This is a film camera.

599
49:28.000 --> 49:29.680
And this is a CCD camera.

600
49:29.760 --> 49:31.400
Are you setting up a camera stall?

601
49:31.480 --> 49:33.000
Of course not!

602
49:33.760 --> 49:35.840
I just want to try each one out.

603
49:35.920 --> 49:38.680
Chen Huimei usually doesn't have time to take me out,

604
49:38.760 --> 49:40.080
so I rarely use them.

605
49:40.160 --> 49:43.000
I'm going to fill them all up with photos today.

606
49:47.120 --> 49:48.760
There's a luggage storage place back there.

607
49:48.840 --> 49:51.440
Keep one camera with you and leave the rest there.

608
49:51.520 --> 49:54.320
-Be good. -Fine. It is a bit heavy.

609
50:10.520 --> 50:12.680
Look. There's a little island over there.

610
50:18.360 --> 50:19.600
Doesn't it look familiar?

611
50:20.760 --> 50:21.920
I've never been here before.

612
50:22.000 --> 50:23.280
How would it look familiar?

613
50:40.440 --> 50:42.160
Then where did you get this photo?

614
50:43.440 --> 50:44.920
I saw it online.

615
50:45.000 --> 50:47.240
I thought it was beautiful, so I saved it.

616
50:48.440 --> 50:51.840
It seems beautiful places aren't always far away.

617
51:04.400 --> 51:05.960
Hurry up.

618
51:22.720 --> 51:23.600
I'll do it.

619
51:45.680 --> 51:46.760
Here we go!

620
52:15.920 --> 52:18.800
You both had your eyes closed when the photo was taken.

621
52:18.880 --> 52:22.840
But since you two brought me out for fun,

622
52:22.920 --> 52:25.720
I'll be generous and let you take up my memory space.

623
52:29.360 --> 52:30.400
Move closer together.

624
52:30.480 --> 52:31.720
You're out of the frame.

625
52:40.160 --> 52:41.480
A little closer!

626
52:52.320 --> 52:53.160
Three.

627
52:54.080 --> 52:54.920
Two.

628
52:56.000 --> 52:56.840
One.

629
53:03.560 --> 53:06.760
Sometimes, I feel like I live in a world of gray.

630
53:06.840 --> 53:09.080
Not the dirty kind of gray,

631
53:09.160 --> 53:12.640
but the kind where debt is a bottomless pit

632
53:12.720 --> 53:14.680
and part-time jobs never end.

633
53:15.840 --> 53:17.480
Life feels so thin.

634
53:17.560 --> 53:18.560
So light.

635
53:19.360 --> 53:20.960
It makes no sound as it falls.

636
53:21.600 --> 53:22.560
Zheng Yu.

637
53:22.640 --> 53:24.960
But he's the kind of person who blows the gray away,

638
53:25.640 --> 53:27.320
pulls you out of it,

639
53:28.120 --> 53:29.920
and takes you out to waste a little time.

640
53:31.000 --> 53:32.640
And that little bit of time

641
53:33.520 --> 53:35.480
is just enough to make life

642
53:35.560 --> 53:37.680
feel breathable again.

643
56:05.720 --> 56:10.720
Subtitle translation by: Cempaka Malinja
